Apps.description:
Introducing MultiCraft ― a world of unlimited opportunities! Get ready for real Adventures!

Build and Destroy Blocks. Get Resources and Create Various Tools, Blocks and Weapons with which you can Survive and create unique Buildings.

Choose your side in this world ― a Builder (Creative mode) or a Ruthless Hunter who will do everything to stay alive (Survival mode)!

► Be careful, in this world there are not only peaceful Animals, but also awful Monsters! Win a battle against them and you will get priceless resources!
► Swim across the seas for new lands and resources ― the lands are unlimited. Explore them!
► If you decide to Survive ― keep an eye on your hunger level and refill it in time! Search for food, grow plants and kill mobs for meat!
► Build your shelter to protect yourself from the monsters, and you will survive the night! They are coming for you… Zombies, Skeletons, Huge Spiders and other hostile mobs.
► At any time, you can fly through the skies with the «Fly» mode or become as fast as a flash with the «Fast» mode.
► You can save your Home Point, create Waypoints, and change the Time of Day. Play by your own rules, because it’s your own world!

In this game your actions are limited only by your imagination! The game does not require any skills ― you can understand it all within the first few minutes of the game. With MultiCraft you can have a good time anywhere and at any time! And it’s totally FREE!

Do you want to play with your friends? Join one of the many custom servers («Multiplayer» tab) or create your own server («Multiplayer» tab) for free. The game has a constantly updated list of various servers. You’re sure to find one you like!

In our game you can expect:
► Cows, pigs, sheep and other peaceful mobs;
► Wolves and Dogs;
► Huge and Small Spiders;
► Insidious Skeletons with Bows;
► Strong Zombies and other hostile mobs;
► Red and Blue ores, mechanisms and hoppers;
► Realistic gameplay;
► Pandas, Penguins and Seals;
► Chickens that lay eggs;
► Stable FPS and world rendering without lag;
► High game optimisation and world generation for all modern devices;
► Many different biomes and unique world terrain;
► A large number of different foods and plants;
► Crafting Guide with a list of all items and recipes;
► Completely revised touch controls for easier gameplay;
► Singleplayer with Survival and Creative modes;
► Easily change the game mode in the Main Menu;
► Faster flight and walking;
► Multiplayer mode on many free servers.
► Free creation of your own server to play with your friends directly in the game menu.

